# Every mesher, steps 1-3 (2026-11-10): the Mesher list holds OpenFOAM's and SALOME's meshers; foamyHexMesh says it is
# experimental; "Convert to polyhedra" shows for meshers whose cells aren't polyhedra already and is saved.
shell python3 "$QC_TESTS/tools/gen_named_box.py" $SB/ws/box.stl
open $SB/ws/cavity
click nav:mesh
wait-until page Mesh
click text:STL mesher
wait 5
click stl-path
enter $SB/ws/box.stl
wait 10
click stl-next
wait 3
click stl-next
wait 3
click stl-next
wait 5
assert text Convert to polyhedra afterwards
click stl-polyconv
wait 3
assert log mesher/mesher.ini poly_convert = 1
click stl-mesher
wait 3
screenshot $OUT/1_list.png
click text:OpenFOAM · Conformal Voronoi: foamyHexMesh (experimental)
wait 5
assert text Experimental: OpenFOAM's conformal Voronoi mesher
assert not text Convert to polyhedra afterwards
screenshot $OUT/2_foamy.png
click stl-mesher
wait 3
click text:OpenFOAM · Tetrahedral: cfMesh tetMesh
wait 5
assert text Convert to polyhedra afterwards
assert log mesher/mesher.ini mesher = cftet
screenshot $OUT/3_tet.png
